  "sections": {
    "overview": "Preline UI provides a collection of prebuilt, customizable components designed to accelerate web application development. Built on Tailwind CSS, it enables developers to rapidly assemble interfaces without starting from scratch. The component library integrates seamlessly with HTML, JavaScript, and TypeScript workflows, supporting modern web development practices. Developers benefit from ready-made, themeable components that reduce repetitive CSS work and maintain design consistency across projects. Preline includes multiple CSS themes and a theme generator tool, giving teams flexibility to customize components to match their brand requirements.\nQuickly set up a responsive navigation bar for a web application using Preline UI components.\nEasily implement modals and dropdowns in your project to enhance user interactivity.\nCustomize and extend prebuilt UI components to fit the specific design needs of your application.\nIntegrate Preline UI with existing Tailwind CSS projects to streamline the development process.",
    "setup": "No install command available. Check the GitHub repository for manual installation instructions.\n`git clone https://github.com/htmlstreamofficial/preline`",
